# Tailscale auth key — the ONE secret this stack needs.
#   cp ts.env.example ts.env && chmod 600 ts.env
# Create a key in the Tailscale admin console (Settings -> Keys). A reusable,
# tagged key is recommended so container recreation can re-join the tailnet.
# The value looks like: tskey-auth-…   (never commit the real one)
TS_AUTHKEY=
